                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ada9872-c05c-44dc-9138-d4cccf9c4336",
                                "sense_id": "ab445359-2db9-363a-bf9b-0f8ba4a88212",
                                "text": "Гомосексуали́зм встреча́ется у всех рас, во всех кла́ссах, у ра́зных профе́ссий; […] Гомосексуали́зм встреча́ется и у живо́тных; так, наприме́р, среди́ коз. […]",
                                "translation": "Homosexuality occurs in all races, in all classes, in different professions; […] Homosexuality is also found in animals; so, for example, among goats. […]",
                                "english": "Homosexuality occurs in all races, in all classes, in different professions; […] Homosexuality is also found in animals; so, for example, among goats. […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
